# Only the bot's code goes into the image. Everything else stays out, above all .env (the bot token), the
# databases, logs and the voice models (those live in volumes, see docker-compose.yml).
*
!bot.py
!config.py
!database.py
!download_voices.py
!requirements.txt
!assets/
!cogs/
!utils/
!activity/
!voices/README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
